{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang='en'>
<head>
  <meta charset='utf-8'>
  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name='description' content='Reach out to {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}} for integrative, whole-person care. No guarantees—just thoughtful plans, education, and partnership.'>
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg1:#f7fbf9; --bg2:#eef7ff; --accent:#7b6cff; --muted:#6b7280; --card:#ffffff; --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      --radius:18px; --max:1100px;
      font-family:Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;
    }
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    html,body{height:100%}
    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg1),var(--bg2));color:#0f172a;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:32px}
    .wrap{width:100%;max-width:var(--max);position:relative}

    /* Diagonal split layout */
    .split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:32px;align-items:stretch;min-height:640px}
    .panel{border-radius:var(--radius);overflow:hidden;position:relative;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(14,20,40,0.08)}

    /* left rich content */
    .left{padding:56px 48px;background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(123,108,255,0.08), rgba(14,165,233,0.04));}
    .diagonal::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(135deg,transparent,rgba(255,255,255,0.6));transform:skewX(-6deg) translateX(-6%);opacity:0.6;pointer-events:none}
    h1{font-size:28px;margin:0 0 12px;letter-spacing:-0.01em}
    .kicker{display:inline-block;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#2dd4bf);color:white;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:18px}
    p.lead{margin:0 0 20px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}

    /* pattern SVG overlay */
    .pattern{position:absolute;right:-10%;top:-10%;width:520px;height:520px;opacity:0.12;transform:rotate(12deg);pointer-events:none}

    /* story cards */
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px;margin-top:18px}
    .card{background:var(--card);padding:14px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(12,14,20,0.04);font-size:14px}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* right contact form */
    .right{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.9),var(--glass));padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}
    .form-head{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .avatar{width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#34d399);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700}
    label{display:block;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:6px;color:var(--muted)}
    input[type='text'],input[type='email'],textarea,select{width:100%;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.06);background:white;font-size:14px}
    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}
    .row{display:flex;gap:12px}
    .row > *{flex:1}
    .checkboxes{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}
    .chip{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fff,#fbfcff);padding:8px 10px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid rgba(11,15,20,0.04);font-size:13px}

    /* CTA */
    .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#34d399);color:white;font-weight:700;border:none;cursor:pointer}
    .ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(12,14,20,0.06);padding:10px;border-radius:10px}

    .meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

    /* testimonials */
    .testimonials{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-top:16px}
    .test{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff, #fbfdff);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(11,15,20,0.03)}

    /* pricing teaser */
    .pricing{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:18px}
    .price{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fff,#fffbf7);padding:14px;border-radius:12px;font-weight:700}

    footer{margin-top:18px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

    /* responsive */
    @media(max-width:920px){
      .split{grid-template-columns:1fr;min-height:auto}
      .pattern{display:none}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class='wrap'>
    <div class='split'>
      <main class='panel left diagonal' aria-labelledby='contact-hero'>
        <svg class='pattern' viewBox='0 0 200 200' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' aria-hidden='true'>
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id='g1' x1='0' x2='1' y1='0' y2='1'>
              <stop offset='0' stop-color='#7b6cff'/>
              <stop offset='1' stop-color='#2dd4bf'/>
            </linearGradient>
            <pattern id='p' width='20' height='20' patternUnits='userSpaceOnUse'>
              <rect width='20' height='20' fill='white'/>
              <circle cx='4' cy='4' r='2' fill='url(#g1)' />
              <circle cx='14' cy='14' r='2' fill='url(#g1)' />
            </pattern>
          </defs>
          <rect width='100%' height='100%' fill='url(#p)' opacity='0.9'/>
        </svg>

        <span class='kicker'>Personalized integrative care</span>
        <h1 id='contact-hero'>Let's make a plan that honors your whole life — body, mind, and rhythm.</h1>
        <p class='lead'>Whether you're curious about an intensive reset, ongoing integrative coaching, or a short education series, we begin with careful listening. We don’t promise cures; we partner with you to understand patterns, test thoughtfully, and design practical steps you can use every day.</p>

        <div class='grid'>
          <div class='card'>
            <strong>Why an intensive?</strong>
            <div class='muted'>An intensive session gives us room to map history, habits, and priorities — ideal when you're ready to dive deeper and leave with a clear, timeboxed plan.</div>
          </div>
          <div class='card'>
            <strong>How I work</strong>
            <div class='muted'>Evidence-informed herbs, movement, nutrition tweaks, and targeted labs when helpful. Education and self-care tools are always central.</div>
          </div>
          <div class='card'>
            <strong>Respectful testing</strong>
            <div class='muted'>Labs are optional and used to illuminate choices — not to label people. Tests are explained in plain language.</div>
          </div>
          <div class='card'>
            <strong>For your schedule</strong>
            <div class='muted'>I offer intensive single sessions and bundled follow-ups for a supported transition back to daily life.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <section aria-labelledby='offers-heading' style='margin-top:20px'>
          <h3 id='offers-heading' style='margin:0 0 8px'>What I offer</h3>
          <p class='muted' style='margin:0'>Intensive consultations, short course follow-ups, and individualized wellness plans. All plans emphasize education, practical habits, and measurable next steps.</p>

          <div class='pricing' role='list'>
            <div class='price'>Intensive + plan</div>
            <div class='price'>3-session bundle</div>
            <div class='price'>Monthly support</div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section aria-labelledby='story-heading' style='margin-top:20px'>
          <h3 id='story-heading' style='margin:0 0 8px'>A little backstory</h3>
          <p class='muted' style='margin:0'>{{PRACTITIONER_NAME}} trained in both conventional and traditional approaches, translating complex findings into clear, gentle practices. The work blends scientific curiosity with a compassionate, whole-person lens.</p>
        </section>

        <section aria-labelledby='testi' style='margin-top:18px'>
          <h3 id='testi' style='margin:0 0 8px'>Voices from the room</h3>
          <div class='testimonials'>
            <div class='test'>"Helped me sleep more nights than not and taught me tools I actually use." — A client in {{CITY}}</div>
            <div class='test'>"We mapped triggers and made small changes that felt doable." — Another client</div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <footer>
          <div class='meta'>No guarantees are made here — care focuses on education, symptom understanding, and practical support. Please consult your primary provider for urgent matters.</div>
        </footer>
      </main>

      <aside class='panel right' aria-label='Contact form'>
        <div class='form-head'>
          <div class='avatar'>{{PRACTITIONER_NAME.split(' ')[0].slice(0,2)}}</div>
          <div>
            <div style='font-weight:700'>{{PRACTITIONER_NAME}} <span style='font-weight:400;color:var(--muted)'>{{CREDENTIALS}}</span></div>
            <div class='muted'>Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} — call <a href='tel:{{PHONE}}' class='muted' style='text-decoration:underline;color:inherit'>{{PHONE}}</a></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <form action='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}' method='post' onsubmit='return handleSubmit(event)'>
          <div>
            <label for='name'>Full name</label>
            <input id='name' name='name' type='text' required placeholder='Your name'>
          </div>
          <div>
            <label for='email'>Email</label>
            <input id='email' name='email' type='email' required placeholder='you@domain.com'>
          </div>
          <div class='row'>
            <div>
              <label for='phone'>Phone (optional)</label>
              <input id='phone' name='phone' type='text' placeholder='(555) 555-5555'>
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for='when'>Preferred timing</label>
              <select id='when' name='when'>
                <option>As soon as possible</option>
                <option>Within 2 weeks</option>
                <option>Flexible</option>
              </select>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <label for='about'>Briefly, what brings you here?</label>
            <textarea id='about' name='about' placeholder='Stress, sleep, digestion, energy shifts...'></textarea>
          </div>

          <div>
            <label>Focus areas (check as relevant)</label>
            <div class='checkboxes' role='group' aria-label='Concerns'>
              <label class='chip'><input type='checkbox' name='concern' value='stress'/> Stress</label>
              <label class='chip'><input type='checkbox' name='concern' value='sleep'/> Sleep</label>
              <label class='chip'><input type='checkbox' name='concern' value='digestion'/> Digestion</label>
              <label class='chip'><input type='checkbox' name='concern' value='inflammation'/> Inflammation</label>
              <label class='chip'><input type='checkbox' name='concern' value='energy'/> Energy</label>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style='display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:6px;align-items:center'>
            <button type='submit' class='btn'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
            <a class='ghost' href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}'>Email {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}</a>
          </div>

          <div class='muted' style='margin-top:10px;font-size:12px'>
            By contacting us you agree to be contacted by phone or email. For urgent care call local emergency services. Testing and plans are educational and individualized; outcomes vary.
          </div>
        </form>

        <script>
          function handleSubmit(e){
            // lightweight local validation + playful confirmation
            e.preventDefault();
            var name=document.getElementById('name').value||'Friend';
            alert('Thanks, '+name+' — your message is on its way. We typically reply within 3 business days.');
            // In production you'd POST here; for now redirect to primary CTA URL if set
            try{var u='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'; if(u && u.indexOf('http')===0) window.location=u;}catch(err){}
            return false;
          }
        </script>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <nav style='margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center'>
      <a href='index.html' class='muted'>Home</a>
      <a href='services.html' class='muted'>Offerings</a>
      <a href='conditions.html' class='muted'>Concerns</a>
      <a href='approach.html' class='muted'>My Way</a>
      <a href='pricing.html' class='muted'>Investment</a>
      <a href='about.html' class='muted'>Who I Am</a>
      <a href='book.html' class='muted'>Book</a>
      <strong style='margin-left:auto;color:var(--accent)'><a href='contact.html' style='text-decoration:none;color:inherit'>Connect</a></strong>
    </nav>
  </div>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"This chunk includes the contact page and usage notes for the holistic/integrative medicine site.

Files included:
- contact.html — a standalone, playful-premium contact page designed for the "split_diagonal" layout family and the "intensive" offer model. It includes: hero, story, offers, pricing teaser, testimonials, and a contact form (the required section pack). The page uses an inline SVG pattern for visual texture and a diagonal split between content and form.

Placeholders (must be replaced during build or templating):
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}
- {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}
- {{CREDENTIALS}}

Integration notes:
- The page is intentionally self-contained with inline styles and an embedded SVG pattern. No external assets or CDNs are required.
- Navigation links point to: index.html, services.html, conditions.html, approach.html, pricing.html, about.html, book.html, contact.html. Adjust labels or paths if your build system uses different routes.
- The contact form posts to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}. For demos the form uses a client-side handler that shows an alert and optionally redirects to PRIMARY_CTA_URL. Replace with your server endpoint or form service.

Holistic practice considerations:
- The copy avoids promises of cures and frames testing and plans as educational and individualized. Keep that tone when translating other pages.
- If you create the conditions and approach pages, include the required content: common concerns (stress, sleep, digestion, inflammation, energy) with disclaimers, and an approach page that describes intake, planning, follow-ups, and optional labs as education.

Styling and assets:
- The page embeds a unique SVG pattern within the HTML. If you prefer a separate asset, extract the <svg> element and save as assets/img/pattern.svg, then update the markup or CSS to reference it.

Accessibility and UX:
- Form fields are labeled and basic validation is performed. Update server-side handling before production use.
- Keep the privacy/disclaimer text visible where contact or intake happens.

If you need alternate layout variants, localized wording, or a static SVG file generated for assets/img/pattern.svg, tell me which preferences and I will produce them in the next chunk."}
BUNDLE_END
